{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-356",
  "title": "Architecture",
  "author": "person:jane-brew:001",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Architecture"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "What Makes a Spatial Workspace Different"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "An agentic IDE is **linear**: code flows through agents sequentially, producing artifacts."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "A spatial workspace is **non-linear**: everything exists in a 2D/3D space simultaneously, with overlapping contexts."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Agentic IDE:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "User → Agent → Code → Tests → Deploy"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "(Sequential, deterministic)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Spatial Workspace:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "┌─── Canvas Node (Figma) ───┐"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "│                           │"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Notion Page ─ Database ─ Mini Spreadsheet"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "│                           │"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "└─── Code Block ────────────┘"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "(interdependent, concurrent)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Your graph architecture is **designed for this**. Here's why:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Part 1: Why This Architecture is Perfect"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Nodes are the Unit of Embedding**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Your architecture already treats everything uniformly:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-22",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```tsx"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "const workspace = {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
